    "text": "Clauses 2 : This clause amends the long title of the Mahapola Higher Education ScholarshipTrust Fund Act, No. 66 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d and thelegal effect of the amendment is to replace the words \u201cMAHAPOLA HIGHER EDUCATIONSCHOLARSHIP TRUST FUND ACT\u201d with the words \u201cLALITH ATHULATHMUDALIMAHAPOLA HIGHER EDUCATION SCHOLARSHIP TRUST FUND ACT\u201d.",
