      283.75,
      451.19,
      302.42
    ],
    "text": "(a)\u201cMahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund Act\u201d with the words \u201cLalithAthulathmudali Mahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund Act\u201d;",
