      139.15,
      341.35,
      451.21,
      379.22
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 3 of the principal enactment and the legal effect ofthe section as amended is to change the composition of the Board of Trustees of the Fund andmake provision to appoint a retired judge of the Supreme Court as the Chairman of theBoard.",
